      "id": "claim_e8d9095eb07f49daa4286b0a85aa31d7",
      "statement": "config.py is the side-effect-free constants layer: it owns the artifact source URLs, the hard limits MIN_BOB_JAVA_MAJOR=25, ENGINE_POST_MAX_BYTES=1024 and DEFAULT_ENGINE_PORT=8001, the six-entry ordered COMPILED_SETTING_KEYS tuple, the cache-dir environment override, and the host-platform triplet mapping.",
